*MISC Devices

* start stop count (step=0)
* start stop step (count=0)
.subckt breakpoint out params: start=300ms step=0.1ns count=100 stop=400ms
.param step1={IF(step==0,(stop-start)/(count+1p),step)}
.param count1={IF(count==0,(stop-start)/step/20,count/20)}
.param frequ={1/20/step1}
V1 out 0 SINE(0 1 {frequ} {start} 0 0 {count1})
.ends

* Z from U,I RMS value
.subckt Z Uin Iin Zout params: TD=100ms mult=1 add=0 div=1
GZ 0 zout VALUE={IF(time>TD,IF(v(Iin)>0,(add+mult*(v(Uin)/v(Iin)))/div,0),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt} rpar=1
.ends

* Z from dU,I with sinusvalues
.subckt Z2 Uin1 Uin2 Iin Zout params: TD=100ms mult=1 add=0 div=1 fc=3
Gdu 0 du VALUE={(V(Uin1,Uin2))} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt} 
Rdu du 0 1
XV2 du Uinrms RMS1b params: T=20m
XI1 Iin Iinrms RMS1b params: T=20m   
GZ2 0 zout VALUE={IF(time>TD,IF(v(Iinrms)>0,(add+mult*abs(v(Uinrms)))/div/v(IinRMS),0),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
RZ2 zout 0 1
.ends

.SUBCKT RMS1b v+ rms params: T=20ms tenable=1us
Gcu 0 V value={v(V+,0)}  tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
Ru  V 0 1
Cu  V 0 {T/1Meg}IC=0
Evu V1  0 value={if(time>tenable,v(V),0)}  tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
Tvu V1  0 V2  0 Z0=75 TD={T}
R2u V2  0 75
Grmsu 0 rms  value={sqrt(v(idt1)/T)*STP(time-T)}  tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
G1x 0 idt1  VALUE={pwr(v(V1),2)-pwr(v(V2),2)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
C1x idt1 0 1 IC=0
R1x idt1 0 1e10
R4u rms  0 1
.ENDS


.subckt RMS1 in out params: fc=100 b0=3 b1=3 lim=1g
Asq 0 in in 0 0 0 sq 0 ota vhigh={lim} rout=1 linear
Adiv_lf _sq sq 0 0 0 0 div 0 ota vhigh={lim} rout=1g cout={1n/fc} linear
Adiv 0 div out 0 0 0 _sq 0 ota vhigh={lim} rout=1 linear
Ab0 out div 0 0 0 0 1 0 ota vhigh={lim} vlow={-lim} cout={.5/pi/fc} rout=1g g={b0/b1} linear
Ab1 out 1 0 0 0 0 out 0 ota vhigh={lim} vlow={-lim} cout={.5/pi/fc} rout=1g g={b1} linear
.ends RMS1

* Gives a 0->1 and hold it if input is from 0->1->0
.subckt pulse2step in out params: td1=100u
A1 in out 0 0 0 0 out 0 OR Td={td1}
.ends

* Gives a 0->1 pulse at the output if 0->1 on the input
* Length of output impulse from parameter trig
* input pulse can be short
.subckt pulse2pulse in trig params: delay=20u
vd d 0 1
A3 d 0 in 0 clr 0 trig 0 DFLOP
A1 trig 0 0 0 0 0 clr 0 BUF Td={delay}
.ends


* Device to reset a ltspice integrator (third parameter)
* Gives a short impulse  if in goes from 0 to 1
* Reset has to be a 0-1-0
* note: td2 > td1
* v(in) is 0->1 and may also go later to 0 again without changing output=v(res)
.subckt step2pulse in res params: td1=100u td2=200u
A1 IN N001 0 0 0 0 res 0 AND Td={td1}
A2 IN 0 0 0 0 N001 0 0 BUF Td={td2}
* R1 Vx N001 100
* V1 Vx 0 pwl 0s 1v
.ends

* gives a ramp at output if
* input is changed from 0 to 1 or 1 to 0 
.subckt step2ramp in ramp params: td=1n trise=100m tfall=100m
A1 in 0 0 0 0 0 ramp 0 OR tfall={tfall} trise={trise} td={td}
.ends






